<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Yamama Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Yamama Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     86.1   vs     87.6</p>
<p> Sales income		 76.0   vs     77.1</p>
<p> Other income		 17.5   vs     17.0</p>
<p> Expenses			4.0   vs	3.4</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  1,374.0   vs  1,327.9</p>
<p> Assets		    1,529.8   vs  1,459.6</p>
<p>Full Name: Yamama Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm is one of eight cement companies operating in Saudi Arabia.</p>
</text>
